    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d5">

                <pb facs="0101" n="33" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg33"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram per cable.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-12-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 1, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Contract disavowed; no harm done. You will learn more by my letter due on
                    Wednesday. If my plan be adopted Morse would be of use here. He will wait orders
                    after you see my report.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
